    "rating": 4,
    "reference": "ChIJUZVpDodHyUwRIGNm2Lk0tek",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Justin Senior",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104122725479843645816/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVjGwmZ3Otjs7UTASH6KswxGWCc0gGP1PR6waPeTasbOO0lpHcs4A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Truly great service every-time! Ive hired them on two separate occasions and they’ve done a great job of installing my units and explaining the best way to use and maintain it. They also work quickly and cleanly 👍🏾👌🏾",
        "time": 1655602060,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "queen lin",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100588332473880907603/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKkzMPiiI9BjI20c_GMTq01mIMxqGzhb2DJj6GRXsUGQ2y2Ag=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Desmair installed the Carrier Heat pump and ventilation system in our house. They have been very quick to answer back even during very busy periods. In the last week they quickly answered a call for my parents who had a heating issue during a cold snap. They were kind, quick, honest and responsive. In short - consistently true professionals! Bravo!",
        "time": 1614123919,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Zeuxis",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103532083739730366417/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVLrJlC3gP7SNZTSphJj7aOvpnRuIqIi63LeGtDEXKbzf9NpbQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Noticed little green/blue wet patch under furnace they installed 2 years ago. I emailed with pictures asking if that’s normal and they said they’ll send a technician. Guy came over within 10-15min told me it’s nothing, and I have to pay $200. Kind of ridiculous if you ask me. If you see after 10min there is no issue why not charge less? I can accept $100 (even though that’s crazy) but charging $200 to tell someone after 10min there is no problem is daytime robbery. Ridiculous.",
        "time": 1663608269,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Randy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109761662138066142222/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKtMDT0eRB-kfDSUG56F8-88jqsSyq4RqmnWW1qyhxCUuMsVA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Desmair was on time and efficient. They had 2 teams come to our place, one team for an air exchanger installation and one team for a ductless AC/heat pump. Both teams were amazing and efficient. Our ONLY issue, and for some would be a major issue, was the air exchanger team came in without tarps and tracked mud and debris all over the house, whereas the ductless AC/heat pump team came in a couple hours later and the first thing they did was lay down tarps where they were to be working.\n\nThis, for my wife, is an issue. For myself, it is about training teams to be more conscientious about the difference between private homes and construction sites and to take cleanliness in private homes more carefully.\n\nOverall, that is why they score a 4 out of 5 for today's otherwise amazing work.",
        "time": 1603483363,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Deborah McHenry",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109644600441536640053/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIY1sq8k0gyZwo87heY4JaamXVRc2UgXX5oqOwSoFyux7--5w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Definitely allocating 5 stars for the service I received.  Extremely satisfied with the relocation of my compressor. Raphael was professional, knowledgeable, efficient , neat and afforded me helpful information concerning my system.   I was very impressed.  Would highly recommend DesMair because of Raphael's qualities.  Thank you sir.     Deborah",
        "time": 1621519554,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
